{
  "_comment": "adk-managed permissions for Claude Code. Merged into ~/.claude/settings.json by install.py. Edit this file and re-run ./install.sh to refresh.",
  "_comment_mcp": "Policy: all MCP tools auto-allow via blanket `mcp__*` in `allow`. The only MCP entries in `ask` are Statsig write tools (gates/experiments/configs/layers/segments — production flag system). Every other class of write/mutate/delete across adk-mcp-* is handled at the constitution level (shared/constitution.md §I.4–§I.7), where the model self-gates: it acts when the task requires the write, and confirms when it doesn't, with a separate gate for non-requested deletions. Non-adk MCPs (claude_ai_*, claude-in-chrome, …) also auto-allow via the same blanket.",
